msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「Huh? Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh? ¿Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hola.」"

msgid "Minori「What are you doing here?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué haces aquí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Waiting for you, Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te estoy esperando, Kushieda.」"

msgid "Minori「......Oh, I see. Been waiting long?」"
msgstr "Minori「......Ah, ya veo. ¿Llevas＿mucho esperando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah, not at all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, para nada.」"

msgid "Minori「I see. That's good then...... So, what's＿up?」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo. Qué bueno......＿Entonces, ¿qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I need to talk to you. I want to pick up＿where we left off a couple nights ago.＿Can I borrow you for a while?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Necesito hablar contigo. Quiero＿retomar lo de hace un par de noches.＿¿Tienes un momento?」"

msgid "Minori「......Okay, sure. I have about an hour＿until work.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Sí, claro. Tengo como una＿hora antes del trabajo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This won't take that long.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No tardaré tanto.」"

msgid "Minori「Did you, perhaps, remember＿everything?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Acaso ya lo recordaste todo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. The night of Christmas Eve,＿before I met with you, I was indeed＿with Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. En Nochebuena, antes de verme＿contigo, sí que estuve con Taiga.」"

msgid "Minori「Gotcha...... Takasu-kun, before we get＿into this, let's go somewhere else.」"
msgstr "Minori「Entiendo...... Takasu-kun, antes de＿empezar, vayamos a otro lugar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sure, I don't mind......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro, no me importa......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But where――」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero ¿adónde――」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You brought me here on purpose?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Me trajiste aquí a propósito?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sunset, indeed......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「El atardecer, claro......」"

msgid "Minori「Now, let's have at it, Takasu-kun!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Bien, vamos a darle, Takasu-kun!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That was an, uhm, interesting＿choice of wording.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Esa fue una elección de＿palabras, ehm, interesante.」"

msgid "Minori「Whoa there, Takasu-kun! That ain't＿enough to defeat me!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Oye, Takasu-kun! ¡Eso no＿basta para derrotarme!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I didn't really come here to defeat＿you. Actually, like I said before, I came＿here to be crushed.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No vine a derrotarte. Como dije antes,＿vine a que me destrozaras.」"

msgid "Minori「Very well, Kushieda is prepared to hold＿up her end of the bargain! Bring it on!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Muy bien, Kushieda cumplirá su＿parte del trato! ¡Adelante!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Look, I'm sorry, but could we not make＿this weird?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mira, perdón, pero ¿podemos＿no hacer esto tan raro?」"

msgid "Minori「Hahahaha! You are speaking to the＿great Kushieda! Such a request is＿impossible!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jajajaja! ¡Estás hablando＿con la gran Kushieda! ¡Eso＿que pides es imposible!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Then just listen, please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Entonces solo escucha, por favor.」"

msgid "Minori「Very well!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Muy bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I said this earlier, but I was able to＿remember everything since then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya lo dije antes, pero desde entonces＿pude recordarlo todo.」"

msgid "Minori「Most splendid of news!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Qué noticia tan espléndida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Since our first year of high school, I＿had, well...... a one-sided crush on you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Desde primer año de preparatoria,＿yo estaba, bueno...... enamorado de＿ti sin ser correspondido.」"

msgid "Minori「A thousand pardons!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Mil disculpas!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, don't apologize for that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no te disculpes por eso.」"

msgid "Minori「Continue!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Continúa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay...... It's just, even though I＿remember it, you don't light my fire, so＿to speak. It's all in the past to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, bien...... Es que, aunque lo＿recuerdo, ya no siento esa chispa,＿por así decirlo. Para mí ya pasó.」"

msgid "Minori「Nothing is forever!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Nada es para siempre!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, that's exactly it...... But that's not＿why...... That's not why I'm switching......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, es justo eso...... Pero no＿es por eso...... No cambio de＿parecer por eso......」"

msgid "Minori「It was right in front of you!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Estaba justo frente a ti!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Reading my mind?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Me lees la mente?」"

msgid "Minori「Hahahaha! Just who do you think I＿am!? I'm not called the Beast Tamer＿for nothin'!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jajajaja! ¡¿Quién crees que＿soy?! ¡No me llaman la Domadora＿de Bestias por nada!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is softball, like, something that hones＿that kind of ability?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿El sóftbol desarrolla esa clase＿de habilidad o algo así?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see...... You're right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo...... Tienes razón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Can you keep your \"WTF!\" to＿yourself? I was serious back then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Puedes guardarte tus \"¡¿Qué＿rayos?!\"? Yo hablaba en serio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Uh, well...... I-It's just, y'know, even＿though I said it's just for appearances,＿I'm still nervous.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Eh, bueno...... E-Es que,＿aunque dije que era una formalidad,＿estoy nervioso.」"

msgid "Minori「Likewise, pal!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Igual que yo, amigo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, sorry. W-Well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, perdón. B-Bueno......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「K-Kushieda!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡K-Kushieda!」"

msgid "Minori「Yes!? I mean, w-what is it!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Sí?! ¡¿Digo, q-qué pasa?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I...... I've liked you since freshman year.＿Please go out with me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo...... Me gustas desde primer＿año. Por favor, sal conmigo.」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That's all I wanted to say. Sorry for＿putting you through this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Eso era todo lo que quería decir.＿Perdón por hacerte pasar por esto.」"

msgid "Minori「You don't need an answer?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿No necesitas una respuesta?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Would you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Me la darías?」"

msgid "Minori「Of course. I believe I told you I＿prepared for this. Under one condition,＿however!」"
msgstr "Minori「Claro. Creo que te dije que＿estaba preparada para esto.＿¡Pero con una condición!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cuál?」"

msgid "Minori「Could you face the other way?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Podrías mirar hacia el otro lado?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, just that......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿solo eso......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Just listen.」"
msgstr "Minori「Solo escucha.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「Thank you, Takasu-kun...... Kushieda's＿so happy, honestly. But I can't go out＿with you. I'm sorry.」"
msgstr "Minori「Gracias, Takasu-kun...... Kushieda＿está muy feliz, de verdad. Pero no＿puedo salir contigo. Lo siento.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... I understand.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... Entiendo.」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun...... I'm really sorry.」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun...... Lo siento mucho.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You don't have to apologize.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No tienes que disculparte.」"

msgid "Minori「Okay......」"
msgstr "Minori「Está bien......」"

msgid "Minori「I didn't hate you at all! Of course I＿didn't!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No me caías nada mal! ¡Claro que no!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But...... Oh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero...... ¡¿Eh?!」"

msgid "Minori「I...... This is what I personally believe＿happiness feels like...... It was wrong to＿pretend it didn't happen...... but......」"
msgstr "Minori「Yo...... Esto es lo que creo que se＿siente al ser feliz...... Estuvo mal＿fingir que no pasó...... pero......」"

msgid "Minori「Sorry, I can't explain it very well......＿Does that make sense?」"
msgstr "Minori「Perdón, no sé explicarlo bien......＿¿Tiene sentido?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............Birds of a feather flock together,＿right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............Dios los cría＿y ellos se juntan, ¿no?」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, that was random of me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, eso salió de la nada.」"

msgid "Minori「No...... You're probably on the right＿track.」"
msgstr "Minori「No...... Quizá no te equivoques.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Minori「......Oh crap!」"
msgstr "Minori「......¡Ay, rayos!」"

msgid "Minori「Hehehe, I take that back. It doesn't＿count. Umpire said I'm safe. Sorry, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Jejeje, lo retiro. No cuenta. El＿árbitro dijo que no estoy eliminada.＿Perdón, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Likewise, I'm sorry to have put you＿through this in the first place.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Yo también lo siento por＿haberte hecho pasar por esto.」"

msgid "Minori「No, on the contrary. This has actually＿healed me, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「No, al contrario. Esto me＿ha sanado, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's good, then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces me alegro.」"

msgid "Minori「Yep. I probably got like 2000＿experience points from this.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí. Creo que gané como 2000＿puntos de experiencia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehh, ¿qué?」"

msgid "Minori「I leveled up. The sun will rise!」"
msgstr "Minori「Subí de nivel. ¡El sol saldrá!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, come to think of it, I feel like I＿had a dream like that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, ahora que lo pienso,＿creo que tuve un sueño así.」"

msgid "Minori「Really?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Minori「I'll keep that in mind...... Actually, we＿shouldn't talk about that while＿standing like this.」"
msgstr "Minori「Lo tendré en cuenta...... De hecho, no＿deberíamos hablar de eso parados así.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, this is ruining the mood.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, esto arruina el ambiente.」"

msgid "Minori「I've probably gone past the cap.」"
msgstr "Minori「Creo que ya superé el límite.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What cap?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué límite?」"

msgid "Minori「Level cap. That aside, I have one final＿request, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「El de nivel. Pero tengo una última＿petición, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Go ahead.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dime.」"

msgid "Minori「Would you leave without looking back?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Podrías irte sin mirar atrás?」"

msgid "Minori「I haven't heard anything about that...... I＿bet you've got a great expression right＿now, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「No he oído nada de eso...... Apuesto＿a que ahora tienes una expresión＿genial, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How come?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Minori「It's a habit of yours.」"
msgstr "Minori「Es una costumbre tuya.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You lost me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Me perdí.」"

msgid "Minori「I'm fine with losing you. Now then,＿Takasu-kun--」"
msgstr "Minori「No me importa que te pierdas.＿Bueno, Takasu-kun--」"

msgid "Minori「Arrideverci!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Arrideverci!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Crap, I messed up! Arrivederci!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Rayos, me equivoqué! ¡Arrivederci!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, now you're Italian?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? ¿Ahora eres italiana?」"

msgid "Minori「Farewell, dear friend! See you at＿school!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Adiós, querido amigo! ¡Nos＿vemos en la escuela!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, see ya!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Ah, nos vemos!」"

msgid "Taiga「......So you were \"splendidly rejected,\"＿huh?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Así que te \"rechazaron＿espléndidamente\", ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yep.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「......*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Taiga「......*Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't sigh over it. This is like, the dawn＿of a new era...... Hmm? It's not dawn, so＿maybe I'm wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No suspires. Es como el amanecer＿de una nueva era...... ¿Mmm? No está＿amaneciendo, ¿me equivoco?」"

msgid "Taiga「......*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Taiga「......*Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Taiga「......*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Taiga「......*Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Taiga「......*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Taiga「......*Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-So yeah...... umm...... Both of us felt＿better afterwards! So it was probably a＿good thing, you know. Probably!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Así que...... ehm...... ¡Ambos＿nos sentimos mejor! Así que debió de ser＿bueno, ¿sabes? ¡Probablemente!」"

msgid "Taiga「......*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Taiga「......*Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Say something.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Di algo.」"

msgid "Taiga「What do you want me to say?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué quieres que diga?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What......? Anything's fine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué......? Lo que sea.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entonces......」"

msgid "Taiga「YOU IDIOT!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡IDIOTA!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí!」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Is that it? Don't you have more to＿say?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eso es todo? ¿No＿tienes más que decir?」"

msgid "Taiga「No.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh you......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ay, tú......」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, that reminds me. What＿happened to the scarf?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, por cierto, ¿qué＿pasó con la bufanda?」"

msgid "Taiga「Wearing that thing around the house＿made me overheat, that's all.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me dio calor usándola en＿casa, eso es todo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Good grief...... Why are you so＿confusing? Why can't I understand＿how your mind works?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Por Dios...... ¿Por qué eres＿tan confusa? ¿Por qué no puedo＿entender cómo piensas?」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up. It's just, y'know, it got dirty.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cállate. Es que, bueno, se ensució.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......? W-Well, I can understand it＿getting dirty, but...... Don't tell me it＿shrank again......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qu......? B-Bueno, entiendo que se＿ensuciara, pero...... No me digas＿que se encogió otra vez......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What? Was it really that dirty?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? ¿Estaba tan sucia?」"

msgid "Taiga「Kinda.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Un poco.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then I'll wash it. Gimme. Taking barely＿soiled stuff to the dry cleaner's --＿MOTTAINAI!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces la lavaré. Dámela. Llevar＿algo apenas sucio a la tintorería＿-- ¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO!」"

msgid "Taiga「No can do!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No puedo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why not?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué no?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Because I don't want you to see.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Porque no quiero que lo veas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't get it. You don't want me to see＿how dirty it is......? What did you do to＿the scarf? Wipe the floor with it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No entiendo. ¿No quieres que vea lo＿sucia que está......? ¿Qué hiciste＿con ella? ¿Limpiaste el piso?」"

msgid "Taiga「Excuse me!? Of course I wouldn't! It's＿just got some dried snot on it...... Oh.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Disculpa?! ¡Claro que no! Solo＿tiene mocos secos...... Ah.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You blew your nose into it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Te sonaste la nariz con ella?」"

msgid "Taiga「As if!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ni que fuera a hacerlo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Popped a snot bubble?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Se te reventó una burbuja de mocos?」"

msgid "Taiga「Did not!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Were you crying?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Estabas llorando?」"

msgid "Taiga「I definitely......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sin duda......」"

msgid "Taiga「..................was.」"
msgstr "Taiga「..................sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......It's my fault. I'm sorry for making＿you wait.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Es mi culpa. Perdón＿por hacerte esperar.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut it, stupid. And don't be so quick＿to apologize. It'll lose its meaning.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cállate, tonto. Y no te disculpes＿tan rápido. Perderá su sentido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Its meaning ain't going anywhere......＿Anyway, just hand wash the dried part＿and it'll come off.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No perderá su sentido...... En fin, lava＿a mano la parte seca y saldrá.」"

msgid "Taiga「Got it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entendido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'll do the rest.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo haré el resto.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno......」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey Taiga...... You did that on purpose,＿didn't you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, Taiga...... Lo hiciste＿a propósito, ¿no?」"

msgid "Taiga「What are you talking about?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿De qué hablas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't you have something to say?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No tienes algo que decir?」"

msgid "Taiga「............*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Taiga「............*Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's with you? I'm your...... I won't＿tell you to be happier, but I mean, at＿least look surprised.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué te pasa? Soy tu...... No＿te pido que te alegres más, pero al＿menos muestra algo de sorpresa.」"

msgid "Taiga「In a way, I AM surprised. At your＿stupidity, that is. That's why I'm just＿going to spare you this time.」"
msgstr "Taiga「En cierto modo, SÍ me sorprende.＿Tu estupidez, claro. Por eso,＿esta vez te perdonaré.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's all I've been hearing for a while＿now. You've always called me an idiot.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hace rato que solo oigo eso.＿Siempre me llamas idiota.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, because you are.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, porque lo eres.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Listen, you, I'm committed to this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Escucha, esto me lo tomo en serio.」"

msgid "Taiga「Committed to what?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué cosa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... y'know! The point is, I'm serious!＿I'd have to do something like this or I'd＿never, EVER get your consent, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... ¡Ya sabes! ¡Hablo en＿serio! Si no hiciera algo así, NUNCA,＿jamás aceptarías, ¿no?」"

msgid "Taiga「......*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Taiga「......*Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So, starting today, I'm in your care......＿No, you're in my care again!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Desde hoy, quedo a tu cuidado...... ¡No,＿tú vuelves a estar a mi cuidado!」"

msgid "Taiga「........................*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Taiga「........................ *Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Oho! You've gone and done＿something quite drastic again!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¡Oh! ¡Otra vez hiciste＿algo muy drástico!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I guess. I'm just glad she didn't turn me＿away at the door.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo. Me alegro de que no me haya＿cerrado la puerta en la cara.」"

msgid "Kitamura「No, actually, I think you've done very＿well, Takasu.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No, en realidad creo que lo＿hiciste muy bien, Takasu.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I agree, if I do say so myself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, opino igual, aunque＿lo diga yo mismo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I haven't told anyone other than you,＿Kitamura. Actually, first of all...... uh,＿well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo te lo he contado a ti, Kitamura.＿De hecho, para empezar......＿eh, bueno......」"

msgid "Kitamura「What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, you see...... as for Yasuko......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, verás...... sobre Yasuko......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ah, so Yasuko-san's opposed to it. I'm＿not surprised.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ah, Yasuko-san se opone.＿No me sorprende.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, not exactly \"opposed\"......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, no es que \"se oponga\"......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Reallyyy......? So Ryuu-chan has found＿someone more precious than this＿house......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿En seriooo......? Así que Ryuu-chan＿encontró a alguien más valioso＿que esta casa......」"

msgid "Yasuko「You're all grown up, Ryuu-chan.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ya eres todo un adulto, Ryuu-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah......」"

msgid "Kitamura「She approved of it!?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡¿Lo aprobó?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That's not exactly it, either.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tampoco es exactamente eso.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Basically......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En pocas palabras......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Howeverrr......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Sin embargooo......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan and Taiga-chan are still in＿high school, so you can't live＿togetherrr～♪」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan y Taiga-chan aún están＿en preparatoria, así que no pueden＿vivir juntosss～♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Eh?!」"

msgid "Taiga「What did I tell you, Ryuuji? There's no＿way Yacchan would allow it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué te dije, Ryuuji? Yacchan＿jamás lo permitiría.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What? What's not to like? I said I'll still＿come make food and clean the house,＿same as always.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? ¿Qué tiene de malo? Dije＿que seguiría viniendo a cocinar＿y limpiar, como siempre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Besides, Yasuko, when you were our＿age, you were already with my dad!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Además, Yasuko, a nuestra edad＿tú ya estabas con mi papá!」"

msgid "Yasuko「That has nothing to do with thiiis～♪」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Eso no tiene nada que verrr～♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, so you're just gonna turn a blind＿eye to it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? ¿Vas a hacer como si nada?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji! Don't say that! Apologize to＿Yacchan!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuji! ¡No digas eso! ¡Discúlpate＿con Yacchan!」"

msgid "Kitamura「What? Was Aisaka against it too?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué? ¿Aisaka también estaba en contra?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then all three of us started talking.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces empezamos a hablar los tres.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Mm, in some sense, that's a natural＿course of action for Yasuko-san.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Mmm, en cierto modo, es una reacción＿natural por parte de Yasuko-san.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But still, I made a major decision, so it's＿not like I could go back on it so easily,＿right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero tomé una decisión importante.＿No podía echarme atrás tan＿fácilmente, ¿no?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Mm, indeed. So, what did you do?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Mmm, es verdad. ¿Y qué hiciste?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「After that, well...... The conversation＿took a weird turn......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Después, bueno...... La charla＿tomó un giro extraño......」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuujiii!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuujiii!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Oh, Kitamura-kun, are you on your＿way home?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ah, Kitamura-kun, ¿ya vas a casa?」"

msgid "Kitamura「No, I've got some work to do in student＿council. What's up, Aisaka? Were you＿perhaps looking for Takasu?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No, tengo trabajo en el consejo＿estudiantil. ¿Qué pasa, Aisaka?＿¿Buscabas a Takasu?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, sorta.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, algo así.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Alright. I'm gonna take off.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bien. Me voy.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Aah! What's the big deal, Kitamura?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Aah! ¿Qué te pasa, Kitamura?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu, we can continue the story＿another time...... Now then, I'll see you＿guys tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu, podemos seguir con＿la historia otro día......＿Bueno, nos vemos mañana.」"

msgid "Taiga「Bye-bye!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Adiós!」"

msgid "Taiga「That's...... true......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso...... es cierto......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why're you turning red?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué te pones roja?」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up! It's your fault I'm thawing!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡Es tu culpa＿que me descongele!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「As if. And by the way, I'm not the one＿who suggested you wait out in the＿cold. You did, Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, cómo no. Y por cierto, yo no＿dije que esperaras afuera con este＿frío. Lo dijiste tú, Taiga.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ngh......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ngh......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nggaahh!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Nggaahh!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Let's go home already.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Vayamos a casa de una vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Stop... My solar plexus... I'll pass out...」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Basta... Mi plexo solar...＿Me voy a desmayar...」"

msgid "Taiga「Go fall in a ditch somewhere. Hmph!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ve a caerte a una zanja. ¡Jum!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「――I thought \"dating\" was, you know,＿sweeter than this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「――Creí que \"salir con alguien\"＿sería más dulce que esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Well, none of it would be possible＿without another person.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bueno, nada de esto sería＿posible sin otra persona.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My person happens to be her. Perhaps＿I should say, this sweet-and-sour affair＿was decided from the start......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En mi caso, es ella. Quizá esta＿relación agridulce estuviera decidida＿desde el inicio......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「...Even so... All things considered, isn't＿this too cruel?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「...Aun así... Pensándolo bien,＿¿no es demasiado cruel?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, hurry it up. Yacchan said she's＿hungry.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, apúrate. Yacchan＿dice que tiene hambre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay...... L-Look, don't you think I＿should go with......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, bien...... M-Mira, ¿no crees＿que debería ir con......」"

msgid "Taiga「No way!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ni hablar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why not......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué no......?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Once a boy leaves home for the sake＿of the girl he likes, he must never step＿foot there againnn～♪」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Cuando un chico deja su casa por la＿chica que le gusta, no debe volver＿a poner un pie en ellaaa～♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't understand that! Then what's＿the point of Taiga staying there......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No lo entiendo! ¿Entonces por＿qué Taiga se queda ahí......?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Taiga-chan is one of us, riiight～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Taiga-chan es de la familia, ¿verdaaad～?」"

msgid "Taiga「Right. When the three of us talked, we＿decided Yacchan would look after me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí. Cuando hablamos los tres, decidimos＿que Yacchan me cuidaría.」"

msgid "Yasuko「That's what it means for a boy to leave＿home～♪ Right?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Así es cuando un chico deja＿su casa～♪ ¿Verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「Right!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Sí!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「RIGHT」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「SÍ」"

msgid "Inko-chan「NO WAY」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「NI HABLAR」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Qu......!」"

msgid "Yasuko「If Inko-chan says no, that's final. Too～＿bad～ for you～!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Si Inko-chan dice que no, es definitivo.＿¡Qué～ lástima～ por ti～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ngggh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ngggh......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I-Is this the happy ending me and＿Taiga get after I overcame all those＿choices? Is this how pathetic I am!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿E-Este es el final feliz de Taiga＿y mío tras superar todas esas＿decisiones? ¡¿Tan patético soy?!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No, wait...... I still have THAT!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No, espera...... ¡Aún tengo ESO!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Taiga, I found this in here earlier.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Taiga, hace rato＿encontré esto aquí.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Oh, that.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ah, eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It says...... \"Takasu Ryuuji-sama.\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dice...... \"Takasu Ryuuji-sama\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I thought doing so would make＿the room spotless, but I can't go in＿that room, so it's impossible.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, creí que así dejaría el cuarto＿impecable, pero no puedo entrar＿ahí, así que es imposible.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then wipe your ass with it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entonces límpiate el trasero con eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not possible either. Because......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tampoco puedo. Porque......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There's something inside.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hay algo adentro.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Huh!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡¿Eh?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Dear Takasu Ryuuji-sama...... Yep, this＿was indeed addressed to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Querido Takasu Ryuuji-sama...... Sí,＿definitivamente era para mí.」"

msgid "Taiga「F-FUUUUCK! Gimme that!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡M-MALDICIÓOOON! ¡¡Dame eso!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No way. MOTTAINAI!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ni hablar. ¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO!」"

msgid "Taiga「Give it back, Ryuuji!! DON'T READ＿IIITTT!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Devuélvemelo, Ryuuji!!＿¡¡NO LO LEEEAS!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That day, Taiga's roar echoed＿throughout the neighborhood.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ese día, el rugido de Taiga resonó＿por todo el vecindario.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I found so, so, so much proof of the＿existence of that one-of-a-kind gentle＿sweetness――」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Encontré tantas, tantas, tantas＿pruebas de la existencia de esa＿dulzura tierna y única――」"

msgid "Taiga「When leaving Narita Airport,＿foreigners well-versed in Japan often＿say \"I can smell the soy sauce.\"」"
msgstr "Taiga「Al salir del aeropuerto de Narita, los＿extranjeros que conocen bien Japón＿suelen decir \"Huele a salsa de soya\".」"

msgid "Taiga「......Hey, can you smell soy sauce?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Oye, ¿hueles salsa de soya?」"

msgid "Taiga「I asked the scary-faced but＿good-natured person standing next to＿me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Le pregunté a la persona de rostro＿temible, pero buen corazón, que＿estaba a mi lado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter? Did you spill your＿in-flight meal?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa? ¿Se te derramó＿la comida del avión?」"

msgid "Taiga「――he responded without a shred of＿interest.」"
msgstr "Taiga「――respondió sin el menor interés.」"

msgid "Taiga「This man has been this impossible for＿as long as I've known him.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Este hombre es así de imposible＿desde que lo conozco.」"

msgid "Taiga「But in exchange for that face, God＿probably gave him a double-dose of＿talent. I'm absolutely sure of it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero seguramente Dios le dio el doble＿de talento a cambio de esa cara.＿Estoy totalmente segura.」"

msgid "???「Ryuu-chaaan! Taiga-chaaan!」"
msgstr "???「¡Ryuu-chaaan! ¡Taiga-chaaan!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, Yasuko! Sorry for making you＿come all this way.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, Yasuko! Perdón por hacerte＿venir hasta aquí.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Nonsense. Couldn't wait around at＿home～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Tonterías. No podía quedarme＿esperando en casa～」"

msgid "Taiga「Yacchan, long time no see!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Yacchan, cuánto tiempo!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Goodness, long time no see indeed～☆」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Cielos, sí que ha pasado tiempo～☆」"

msgid "Yasuko「Nevertheless, Taiga-chan, you've＿gotten so biggg～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Pero, Taiga-chan, ¡cuánto＿has crecidooo～!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Did you say you're having triplets～?＿Sure looks that wayyy.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Dijiste que son trillizos～?＿Eso pareceee.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup. I can't believe they all fit in there.＿It's a mystery of the human body!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí. No puedo creer que quepan todos ahí.＿¡Es un misterio del cuerpo humano!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You should apply to be one of the＿Seven Wonders of the World.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Deberías postularte como una de las＿Siete Maravillas del Mundo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Maybe I will.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Quizá lo haga.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Fufu, Yacchan will be a grandma＿soonnn～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Juju, Yacchan pronto será abuelaaa～」"

msgid "Taiga「......Hey, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Oye, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... I was probably thinking the same＿thing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... Creo que pensaba lo mismo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, that's right. In the dream, Yacchan＿was laughing, surrounded by all her＿puppy grandchildren.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, es verdad. En el sueño,＿Yacchan reía rodeada de todos＿sus nietos cachorros.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Huh～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Eh～?」"

msgid "Taiga「We fell silent, and Yacchan was＿overcome with big question marks.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nos quedamos callados y a Yacchan＿se le llenó la cara de signos＿de interrogación.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji laughed. I started to giggle――」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji se rio. Yo empecé a reír bajito――」"

msgid "Yuri「Hello. First of all, perhaps I should＿thank you for your hard work,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hola. Antes que nada, quizá deba＿agradecerte tu esfuerzo, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now that you got this ending, the＿reason I brought you here......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora que llegaste a este final, la＿razón por la que te traje aquí......」"

msgid "Yuri「......is none other than to discuss the＿route you chose. I thought we could＿ponder it together.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......es hablar de la ruta que＿elegiste. Pensé que podríamos＿reflexionar juntos.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's evaluate the ending you＿just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, evaluemos el final＿que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Welcome, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bienvenido, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's begin to evaluate the＿ending you just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, comencemos a evaluar el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「I see. After remembering everything,＿you chose Aisaka-san.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ya veo. Tras recordarlo todo,＿elegiste a Aisaka-san.」"

msgid "Yuri「Congratulations! I mean it. I give you＿my sincerest blessing.」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Felicidades! Lo digo en serio. Te＿doy mi más sincera bendición.」"

msgid "Yuri「Oh, I know. As I recall, you became an＿interior designer, yes?」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ah, ya sé. Si mal no recuerdo, eres＿diseñador de interiores, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Yuri「In that case, can I ask you to renovate＿my place? No budget restrictions!」"
msgstr "Yuri「En ese caso, ¿puedo pedirte＿que renueves mi casa? ¡Sin＿límite de presupuesto!」"

msgid "Yuri「After all, I'm sitting on a big nest egg......＿Ahahahaha......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Después de todo, tengo mucho dinero＿ahorrado...... Ajajajaja......」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, you don't have to fake your＿laughter.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, no hace falta que finjas reírte.」"

msgid "Yuri「This ending is obviously worth the full＿100 points! Keep this level of effort＿going forward!」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Este final merece los 100 puntos, sin＿duda! ¡Sigue esforzándote así!」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, that's all for today. Until next＿time!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, eso es todo por hoy.＿¡Hasta la próxima!」"

msgid "『Music』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Música』 ya está disponible en 『Extras』"

msgid "『Album』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Álbum』 ya está disponible en 『Extras』"

msgid "Minori「Traditionally, when having this kind of＿conversation, it's practically a given＿that you have it somewhere like this,」"
msgstr "Minori「Por tradición, una conversación así debe＿tenerse en un lugar como este,」"

msgid "Minori「where you can see the sunset.」"
msgstr "Minori「donde se vea el atardecer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No matter if you judge me, even if you＿talk shit about me, even then...... It's＿like, I now see what's truly important」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Aunque me juzgues o hables mal de＿mí, aun así...... Ahora veo lo que de＿verdad importa」"

msgid "Ryuuji「to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「para mí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Look, when I met Kitamura for lunch......＿Well, he knew there were only two＿possibilities, but it still felt like he saw」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuando almorcé con Kitamura......＿Sabía que solo había dos opciones, pero＿aun así sentí que me había」"

msgid "Ryuuji「right through me......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「descubierto......」"

msgid "Minori「Nope, you're wrong. We've simply been＿keeping an eye on you two, that's all.＿Since spring of last year, at」"
msgstr "Minori「No, te equivocas. Solo hemos＿estado pendientes de ustedes dos, nada＿más. Desde la primavera pasada,」"

msgid "Minori「point-blank.」"
msgstr "Minori「muy de cerca.」"

msgid "Minori「Partway through, there were times I＿was like \"WTF!\" and such...... But＿ultimately, you've reached your」"
msgstr "Minori「Por el camino a veces pensé cosas＿como \"¡¿Qué rayos?!\"...... Pero al final＿llegaste a tu」"

msgid "Minori「destination, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「destino, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Minori「W-Well, I didn't think that all the time,＿and of course I didn't mean to insult＿you! Now, if you please, would you say」"
msgstr "Minori「B-Bueno, no siempre lo pensaba.＿¡Y no quería insultarte! Ahora, por＿favor, ¿podrías decir」"

msgid "Minori「the words from that day!?」"
msgstr "Minori「lo que ibas a decir aquel día?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hey, if you don't mind, could I hear＿your reason? If...... If my memory＿serves me, umm...... it wasn't that you」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Oye, ¿puedo saber por qué?＿Si...... Si recuerdo bien, ehm...... no＿es que te」"

msgid "Ryuuji「hated me......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「cayera mal......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. If you happen to evolve into a＿demon lord, please don't cut Sensei's＿red string of fate. It'll drive her to buy」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Si te vuelves reina demonio,＿no cortes el hilo rojo de la profesora.＿La harás comprar」"

msgid "Ryuuji「a defective condo.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「un departamento defectuoso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You know, I gotta ask, is leaving＿without showing your face the new＿cool thing to do? Is it something from」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tengo que preguntar: ¿irse＿sin mostrar la cara se considera genial＿ahora? ¿Es algo de」"

msgid "Ryuuji「a TV show?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「un programa de televisión?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Anyway, you don't have to be anxious＿or worried, Taiga. On the contrary, it's＿more like we deepened our friendship」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En fin, no tienes que inquietarte＿ni preocuparte, Taiga. Al contrario,＿nuestra amistad se afianzó」"

msgid "Ryuuji「through our fists.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「a puñetazos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Even I sometimes do my own thing＿without you needing to tell me. And＿Kushieda even said it actually healed」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......A veces también actúo por＿mi cuenta sin que me lo digas. Kushieda＿hasta dijo que eso fue sanador para」"

msgid "Ryuuji「her.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「ella.」"

msgid "Taiga「Calm your tits. I didn't put it in the＿washing machine like last time. I'll take＿it to the dry cleaner's, so just hold your」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tranquilízate. No la metí en la＿lavadora como la otra vez. La llevaré a＿la tintorería, así que」"

msgid "Taiga「horses.」"
msgstr "Taiga「ten paciencia.」"

msgid "Taiga「Not even middle schoolers run away＿from home nowadays! And we're right＿next door! I can't think of anything」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ya ni los de secundaria se＿escapan de casa! ¡Y estamos justo al＿lado! No se me ocurre nada」"

msgid "Taiga「more ridiculous.」"
msgstr "Taiga「más ridículo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「When I heard about all this over the＿phone, I was curious about how it＿happened, but I could never have」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Cuando me lo contaste por teléfono,＿me dio curiosidad saber cómo pasó,＿pero jamás habría」"

msgid "Kitamura「imagined this.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「imaginado esto.」"

msgid "Kitamura「But still, a couple of high school＿students living together...... As your＿friend, I'm cheering for you, but as the」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Pero dos estudiantes de preparatoria＿viviendo juntos...... Como amigo,＿los apoyo, pero como」"

msgid "Kitamura「student council president...... Hmm,＿isn't it better not to make this public＿for the time being?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「presidente del consejo estudiantil......＿Mmm, ¿no sería mejor mantenerlo en＿secreto por ahora?」"

msgid "Yasuko「It's kinda lonely, but...... Ryuu-chan's＿gotta leave the nest sometime.＿Yacchan will give you a proper」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Me siento algo sola, pero......＿Ryuu-chan debe dejar el nido algún día.＿Yacchan te dará una buena」"

msgid "Yasuko「send-off thennn.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「despedidaaa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's like, she seemed to appreciate how＿I felt, but...... Then, while the two of us＿were arguing, she tried to compromise」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Parecía apreciar lo que sentía,＿pero...... Mientras discutíamos,＿intentó lograr un acuerdo」"

msgid "Ryuuji「by having Yasuko acknowledge it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「haciendo que Yasuko lo aceptara......」"

msgid "Taiga「......So? What was this conversation＿that kept me waiting at the gates in＿this freezing weather? Don't tell me it」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Y bien? ¿De qué hablaban＿para dejarme esperando en la entrada con＿este frío? No me digas que」"

msgid "Taiga「was nothing much......」"
msgstr "Taiga「no era nada importante......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing super important. But＿Kitamura's really helped me out, so I＿had to fill him in on the situation to」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nada muy importante. Pero＿Kitamura me ayudó mucho y tenía que＿ponerlo al tanto」"

msgid "Ryuuji「some extent, you know?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「hasta cierto punto, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What part of this is \"a normal high＿school relationship\"? These days,＿blushing while waiting for someone is」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En qué es esto \"una relación＿normal de preparatoria\"? Ahora,＿sonrojarse al esperar a alguien es」"

msgid "Ryuuji「so cliche.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「todo un cliché.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So I'll stay here and Taiga stays＿there...... Then every day I bring food＿over...... You guys eat together and I eat」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo me quedo aquí y Taiga allá......＿Y llevo comida a diario...... Ustedes＿comen juntas y yo como」"

msgid "Ryuuji「alone......? I, I won't consent to this!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿solo......? ¡Y-Yo no＿voy a aceptar esto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Et tu, Inko-chan...... Oh yeah, Yasuko,＿can I take Inko-chan with me? This＿house is just too big and empty for one」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tú también, Inko-chan...... Ah,＿Yasuko, ¿me llevo a Inko-chan? La casa＿es demasiado grande y vacía para una」"

msgid "Ryuuji「person.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「persona.」"

msgid "Taiga「So what? It's empty anyway.＿MOTTAINAI? Then why don't you use it＿to patch the hole I put in the door the」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y qué? Está vacío. ¡QUÉ＿DESPERDICIO!, ¿eh? ¿Y si tapas con eso＿el agujero que hice en la puerta el」"

msgid "Taiga「other day?」"
msgstr "Taiga「otro día?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The landlady downstairs complained,＿Yasuko was in emotional distress＿accordingly, and Inko-chan developed」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La casera de abajo se quejó,＿Yasuko sufrió angustia por ello＿e Inko-chan desarrolló」"

msgid "Ryuuji「temporary PTSD. And I'm sorry for all＿of that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「estrés postraumático temporal. Y＿lo siento por todo eso......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「To pay for the extensive damages I＿caused them, in the middle of that＿surprisingly well-written text string,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para pagar por los graves daños que＿les causé, en medio de ese texto＿sorprendentemente bien escrito,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「yo......」"

msgid "Taiga「But for me, Japanese through and＿through, even after returning to my＿country after a few years abroad, I」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero yo, japonesa de pies a＿cabeza, incluso al volver a mi país tras＿unos años en el extranjero,」"

msgid "Taiga「didn't notice it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「no lo noté.」"

msgid "Taiga「Speaking of change, he grew up,＿graduated high school and college, and＿is currently working as an interior」"
msgstr "Taiga「Él sí cambió: creció, terminó＿la preparatoria y la universidad,＿y ahora es diseñador de」"

msgid "Taiga「designer in Milan.」"
msgstr "Taiga「interiores en Milán.」"

msgid "Taiga「When he said he wanted to go to Italy, I＿thought he was out of his mind. But＿he's young and independent, and now」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cuando dijo que quería ir a Italia,＿lo creí loco. Pero es joven e＿independiente y ahora」"

msgid "Taiga「he's working out of a nice office. It＿means a lot to him.」"
msgstr "Taiga「trabaja en una linda oficina.＿Eso significa mucho para él.」"

msgid "Taiga「Gallantly dressed in a freshly bought＿suit custom-made by a top designer,＿it's somehow maddening to hear him」"
msgstr "Taiga「Va elegante con su traje nuevo hecho＿a medida por un gran diseñador, y de＿algún modo me irrita oír que lo」"

msgid "Taiga「called \"up-and-coming.\"」"
msgstr "Taiga「llaman \"promesa del diseño\".」"

msgid "Taiga「Still, why hadn't this person changed＿at all? I feel like she's matured since＿he left, and yet she still only looks to」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero ¿por qué ella no cambió nada?＿Creo que maduró desde que él se fue,＿pero aún aparenta unos」"

msgid "Taiga「be about 30. Definitely a fraud.」"
msgstr "Taiga「30 años. Todo un fraude.」"

msgid "Taiga「Is it the soy milk? Or is it the work of＿kefir? At any rate, at＿Bishamontengoku I'm sure she could」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Será la leche de soya? ¿O el kéfir?＿En fin, estoy segura de que en＿Bishamontengoku podría」"

msgid "Taiga「fight with the charm of her smile for＿another 10 years.」"
msgstr "Taiga「seguir luchando con su sonrisa＿encantadora otros 10 años.」"

msgid "Taiga「Smiling ear to ear, she gazes tenderly＿at me. She's not talking about my＿height. It's the size of my belly after 8」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sonriendo de oreja a oreja, me＿mira con ternura. No habla de mi altura,＿sino del tamaño de mi vientre tras ocho」"

msgid "Taiga「months of pregnancy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「meses de embarazo.」"

msgid "Taiga「My better half, who I once called a dog,＿started to blush. It's a little late to get＿embarrassed about it, you know? How」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mi media naranja, a quien llamaba perro,＿se sonrojó. Ya es un poco tarde para＿avergonzarte, ¿no? ¿Cuántos」"

msgid "Taiga「many years have we been married?」"
msgstr "Taiga「años llevamos casados?」"

msgid "Taiga「Speaking of dogs, it's like I'm having a＿litter myself. Guess that makes me a＿bitch. Get it? It's a joke-- Hm? This」"
msgstr "Taiga「Hablando de perros, yo también＿tendré una camada. Seré una perra.＿¿Entiendes? Es broma-- ¿Mmm? Este」"

msgid "Taiga「outcome...... Huh?」"
msgstr "Taiga「resultado...... ¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「It was like a midsummer night's dream＿we once had. Married to a dog, living in＿a doghouse, with countless puppies,」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como aquel sueño de una noche de＿verano: casada con un perro, en una casa＿de perros, con incontables cachorros,」"

msgid "Taiga「living a life of poverty......」"
msgstr "Taiga「viviendo en la pobreza......」"

msgid "Taiga「The dream I had that summer wasn't＿half bad, and I started to long for it.＿Now it seems I've made it come true」"
msgstr "Taiga「El sueño de aquel verano no estaba＿nada mal y empecé a desearlo. Ahora＿parece que lo hice realidad」"

msgid "Taiga「with my own two hands.」"
msgstr "Taiga「con mis propias manos.」"

msgid "Yuri「I'll come and see you every time you＿reach an ending.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Vendré a verte cada vez que＿llegues a un final.」"

msgid "Yuri「I want you to reflect on the actions you＿made this time and keep them in mind＿for next time.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Quiero que reflexiones sobre tus＿acciones de esta vez y las tengas＿presentes para la próxima.」"
